Defect found and fixed this phase:
  Heel numbering was off by one - crossing the first heel announced 'Turn 2'.
  Existing specs asserted only that an announcement fired with a non-empty
  message, so none could catch it. Found by running the built package.

Design property worth preserving: applyDistance has no code path to 'unlocked'.
Unlock parity between modalities is therefore structural, not merely asserted -
a future caller cannot grant unlock from a stepping entry point.

